<p>momino aaj qurasaa'n me hai taaza maatam<br />
thar tharaate hai falak arsh-o- zamee'n loh-o-qalam<br />
aate hai aal-e- abaa qaak udaate baaham<br />
aabid-o- baaqar-o- jaafar wa janaab-e- kaazim</p>

<p>mu ko sab ahle aza aanso'n se dhote hai<br />
jama mayyat ke uthaane ke liye hote hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kya kiya qehr ke be jurm-o- qataa ko maara<br />
dilbar-e- faatema-o- sher-e- quda ko maara<br />
zeher dilwaake gharibul ghuraba ko maara<br />
aaj maamoon ne mazloom raza ko maara</p>

<p>qaak me milgaya ek aur gul-e- baaghe zehra<br />
gul huwa aaj qurasaa'n me charaaghe zehra<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>is tarha waaqeya hai aaj ka raawi ne likha<br />
ibn-e- haaroon ne hazrat ko ju hi bulwaaya<br />
aaye darbaar me jis waqt imaam-e- dosaraa<br />
taqt par apne qari'n shaah ko bhi bithlaaya</p>

<p>phir kaha shaah se farmaaiye to pesh karoo'n<br />
aap ke waaste angoor mai le rakkha hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kaha mazloom ne mujh ko nahi angoor ki chaah<br />
kisi liye saamne hai tasht jo tu ne rakkha<br />
kiya israar jo usne to imaam-e- zeejaah<br />
khake angoor ko kehne lage inna lillah</p>

<p>poocha maamoon ne kya baat hai farmaaiyega<br />
sar jhuka kar kaha masmoom ne maloom huwa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>khake angoor-e- dagha aaye hai ghar ko apne<br />
qai kiye jaate hai pakde huwe sar ko apne<br />
dard hota hai dabaate hai jigar ko apne<br />
yaad farmaate hai hamsheer-o- pisar ko apne</p>

<p>syed-o- bekas-o- mazloom gharibul ghuraba<br />
muztarib haal hai masmoom gharibul ghuraba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mout ka aagaya chehre pa pasina yaaro<br />
ghash me hai waaris-e- sultaan-e- madina yaaro<br />
aathwaan mohr-e- nabuwaat ka nagina yaaro<br />
qaak me milta hai ahmed ka qazina yaaro</p>

<p>dar-o- deewaar ko hasrat se raza dekhte hai<br />
aur unhe yaas se sab aal-e- abaa dekhte hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>peet'ti hai kabhi sar ko kabhi tharrati hai<br />
faatema istarha rone ke liye aati hai<br />
jaanib-e- arsh-e- ulaa rooh-e- raza jaati hai<br />
bekasi laash pa roro ke ye chillaati hai</p>

<p>mout ki hichkiyaa'n ab leta hai dibar uska<br />
chaar hammaal uthaaye the janaaza jiska<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sach hai ghurbat ki ajab mout hai aye ehle azaa<br />
naa koi monis-o- yaawar na dawaa hai na ghiza<br />
bistar-e- marg pa the aap tawakkal ba qudaa<br />
naa koi paani pilaane ko dam-e- aaqir thaa</p>

<p>wahi bekas hai raza naz'aa me inna lillah<br />
haaye kya waqt hai mazloom pe allah allah<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qaak ka farsh ridaa gard tawakkal takyaa<br />
uf bhi karta nahi qaamoosh hai sone waala<br />
naz'aa me dekha raza ne jo shabi-e- zehra<br />
band aankhe huwi aur qaatema bilqair huwa</p>

<p>ek hichki ka bas aana tha ke dam tod gaye<br />
momino ke liye yaad apni raza chod gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aake yasrab se taqi dekhte hai kya naqsha<br />
band aankhe kiye behosh pade hai baba<br />
sar ko baba ke utha zaanu pa apne rakha<br />
roke chillane lage kya ye huwa hai aba'ta</p>

<p>kab se chillata hai sar peet ke nalaan taqi<br />
aankho'n ko kholo zara aap ke qurbaan taqi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baap ka pursa do bete ko tum aye ehle azaa<br />
jisko mamoon ne khilwaaya hai angoor-e- daghaa<br />
neelgoo'n hogaya hai jism-e- mubarak jiskaa<br />
jiski mayyat pa nahi koi bhi rone waala</p>

<p>be pidar hogaye masmoom taqi waawailaa<br />
haaye bejaa'n huwa kaazim ka wasi waawailaa<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>